{"articleNo":"502685","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=502685&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2024년 (재)구미시장학재단 '지역대학-지역 내 취창업 연계 장학생' 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.11.28","hit":"10099","attachments":[{"name":"(공고문) 2024년도 구미시장학재단 「지역대학-지역 내 취ㆍ창업 연계 장학생」 선발 공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=502685&attachNo=139073"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">▣ 구미시 우수인재의 지역 내 취창업 및 정착을 지원하기 위해 2024년 (재)구미시장학재단&nbsp;'지역대학-지역 내 취창업 연계 장학생'을</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아래와 같이 선발하오니 관심있는 졸업자의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">2024. 11. 27.(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0p