eight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">120</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">만원 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">온라인 또는 방문 접수&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">공휴일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">평일 점심시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(12~13</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;(온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">구미시장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(www.gumigh.or.kr)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"11976\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">방  문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">구미시청 교육청소년과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">구미시 송원서로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-fam